00:45:34.170 --> 00:45:37.230
First, let's look
at damage rolls.

00:45:37.230 --> 00:45:40.980
This is just a fake demo set.

00:45:40.980 --> 00:45:45.540
We're looking at, again,
all this stuff live.

00:45:45.540 --> 00:45:47.610
So we're querying the
database, and I just

00:45:47.610 --> 00:45:49.949
