00:45:56.880 --> 00:45:59.370
but this is all just running
directly in database.

00:45:59.370 --> 00:46:00.960
So we're writing the SQL here.

00:46:00.960 --> 00:46:02.970
The user doesn't need
to understand anything,

00:46:02.970 --> 00:46:05.880
and this is all
mediated with the model.

00:46:05.880 --> 00:46:10.237
If we want to actually dig in
to level 10 and what happened,

00:46:10.237 --> 00:46:12.070
we can create these
metrics in the back-end.

00:46:15.370 --> 00:46:18.820
And actually I
discovered this earlier,

00:46:18.820 --> 00:46:21.040
but it looks like we
kind of arbitrarily

00:46:21.040 --> 00:46:25.624
made the boss of level 10
substantially different

00:46:25.624 --> 00:46:27.040
than the rest of
the other bosses.

00:46:27.040 --> 00:46:31.180
So level 9, our boss has kind
of low armor and all this stuff,

00:46:31.180 --> 00:46:33.140
and then suddenly our
boss gets really hard.

00:46:33.140 --> 00:46:36.160
So again, none of this
is rocket science.

00:46:36.160 --> 00:46:41.170
But because all of this data
is so query-able and so easily

00:46:41.170 --> 00:46:43.870
accessible, all this stuff
comes right out of the box.

00:46:43.870 --> 00:46:48.340
And all of this is mediated
with this data model--

00:46:48.340 --> 00:46:53.680
sorry, I'm really
struggling here--

00:46:53.680 --> 00:46:57.100
with this data model
that's writing raw SQL.

00:46:57.100 --> 00:46:58.960
Again, the key takeaway here--

00:46:58.960 --> 00:47:02.380
record everything, take
advantage of these really

00:47:02.380 --> 00:47:04.360
heavily managed services,
and then make sure--

00:47:04.360 --> 00:47:06.400
as you're putting
tooling on top of it--

00:47:06.400 --> 00:47:08.150
to think about what
you want to take

00:47:08.150 --> 00:47:09.400
advantage of in that pipeline.

00:47:09.400 --> 00:47:11.770
Whether it's
latency, or depth of

00:47:11.770 --> 00:47:15.130
explore ability, or
interactivity for your users,

00:47:15.130 --> 00:47:19.330
and try to learn from models
that you've seen elsewhere.

